Z||000003||BlackARROW||10-08-2001||09:04 PM||||I had powerloss too not so long ago (even had a stall)  So I brought my car to have the timing checked, and it was a bit off.  They've have reseted it, and not it runs smoother, and it still kicks above 88mph  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>So if all the things you try doesn't work out, you may check that.<P><P>------------------<BR>BlackARROW &gt;&gt;--&gt;<BR>Gadgeteered Fiero 2M4 '85<BR>"Get your groove on"||||reg||3
